+# GtV 1.2.5 clientfix3
+
+Server requirement: keep Dynamic Library 1.2.5 unchanged.
+
+## Fixes
+
+- Keeps clientfix2 focused-episode enrichment/source picker behavior unchanged.
+- Re-resolves audio/subtitle preferences after selected-source PlaybackInfo returns real ffprobe MediaStreams.
+- Explicit saved/user audio selection wins over container default/forced disposition.
+- If there is no explicit audio selection, real-stream language preference is resolved before falling back to default/first track.
+- Audio-only track changes no longer require subtitle selection to succeed.
+- Subtitle-only track changes no longer require audio selection to succeed.
+- Audio-only changes preserve the current subtitle override, including an already-loaded external subtitle.
+- Embedded subtitle changes apply in-place and preserve audio playback.
+- Adds diagnostic logging for probed audio metadata and direct track-change results.
+- Adds regression tests verifying audio-only/subtitle-only changes preserve the other override in shared ExoPlayer groups.
+
+## Windows build
+
+From the extracted source root in PowerShell:
+
+```powershell
+$env:JAVA_HOME = "C:\Program Files\Android\Android Studio\jbr"
+$env:ANDROID_HOME = "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\Android\Sdk"
+.\gradlew clean assembleDefaultDebug --max-workers=1 "-Dorg.gradle.jvmargs=-Xmx6g -Dfile.encoding=UTF-8"
+```
+
+ARM64 output should be under:
+
+```text
+app\build\outputs\apk\default\debug\
+```
+
+## Install
+
+```powershell
+adb connect 192.168.68.107:5555
+adb install -r <arm64-debug-apk>
+adb shell monkey -p com.github.damontecres.wholphin.debug 1
+```
+
+## Useful log filter
+
+```powershell
+adb logcat -c
+adb logcat | Select-String "Resolved probed source tracks|Probed audio|Track selection|Direct track change|Changes tracks|Changing audio|Changing subtitle|Enriched focused episode"
+```
+
+Expected for an English switch from a Polish/Italian default source:
+
+```text
+Changing audio track to 2
+Track selection kind=audio ... jellyfinLanguage=eng ... matchedTrackIndex=1 ...
+Direct track change requestedType=AUDIO ... audioResult=SELECTED ...
+Changes tracks audio=2 ... requestedType=AUDIO overrideApplied=true
+```
